        ],
        "description": "The North Freeway carved a wide path through the historically Black Fifth Ward and Kashmere Gardens neighborhoods, demolishing hundreds of homes and severing the tight-knit community fabric. Near Northside, a predominantly Hispanic neighborhood, was similarly bisected, cutting residents off from schools, churches, and commercial districts."
